{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56546","headline":"还丹歌 十五 · 杨行真人","name":"还丹歌 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"能知少女，必定还精。\n能伏朱儿，必定坚贞。\n金精石髓，是魂之灵。\n能修者圣，能伏者灵。\n鬼官不追，仙籍有名。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨行真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}